Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wealth, Fame, Power.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,200)\fs35}Editing{\r}\NFeeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,200)\fs35}Timing{\r}\NKaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.88,0:00:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attained this and everything\Nelse the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Quality Control{\r}\NFeeso\NGalaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NSewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his dying words drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Soundtracking{\r}\NHalee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Graphics{\r}\NDatenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Karaoke{\r}\NKaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,{\alpha&H10&\an7\fad(600,600)\fs35}Translation{\r}\NGaijin\NFUNimation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.86,0:00:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.74,0:01:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.33,0:01:53.46,Title-480p,,0,0,0,,{\fad(460,0)}Parallels
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:01:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A message from headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just received word that Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy and his pirate crew are headed\Nto Log Town from the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bounty on his head has just\Nbeen raised to 30 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,30 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to congratulate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, this is the pirate that defeated\NDon Creek and destroyed Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your whining made\Nit collapse in defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir. Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stress is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You alone dictate the pace of your battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why so tense?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's been a long time since I faced a\Npirate group of this considerable strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really have nothing to worry\Nabout under my command has there been
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even a single pirate to set foot on this\Nisland without being captured No, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just calm the hell down.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.53,0:03:03.57,Captions-480p,,0,0,5,,{\fad(300,0)}Captain "White Hound" Smoker\NNavy Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're screwing up my pacing marine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporting sir, I have word that a\Npirate group has recently arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're requested there at\Nonce It must be Luffy's group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got this 30 million, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might actually be interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just talking to myself, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see this, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, you have to tell\Nus what your orders are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, do you even know who\Nthis pirate's defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Tashigi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, she mentioned to me that she\Nhad some things to do this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.04,0:03:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that she tried to make\Nit back in time for training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Irresponsible, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell's she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better slow it down or\Nyou're gonna drop it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am very sorry, sir!\NPlease don't hurt her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My daughter shouldn't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My silly pants have\Neaten all your ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, go buy yourself five scoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have at it, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to be shy on my\Naccount! I, Call the Crescent,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hereby proclaim all of your food to be at\Nservice to the future King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't bother trying to hide anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's in charge here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you need to\Nleave So you're Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not worth 30 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:05:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're not worth much more\Nthan my grandma's false teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare speak to me that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is definitely one of the toughest\NMarines we've ever seen in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, Log Town used to be a hangout\Nfor pirates headed to the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.54,0:05:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as Smoker took over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any pirate that's ever come near this\Nisland has been caught, incarcerated,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoker is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a complete and utter monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are even those who say\Nhe has Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You captured Luffy all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a complete idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone could tell that. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this garbage was worth 30\Nmillion, I'd become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.24,0:06:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's your hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be here soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where's the execution platform?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.16,0:06:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like the docks. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he a member of this garbage?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so. Not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to know where\Nthey execute people around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The platform. Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't seem to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my first time here on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The town is a whole lot\Nbigger than Fuchsia Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's really spread out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why go to the platform?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Personal quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To see where the king of the pirates died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't know. Oh, well. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just follow the smoke, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great! That way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really sucks. Damn, I just\Nwant to find the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,platform but somehow i keep\NGetting myself turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find it eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, do you work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sign hanging outside said this\Nplace is called the Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd it get that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a place for\Nunaccompanied children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we're closed\Nfor good starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going under?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going under.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to shut it down myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm retiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just wanted\Nto know about the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I'm looking for the\Nexecution platform, but I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you tell me the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's a huge skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killer Giant,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the most feared villains to ever\Nhaunt the waters of the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sent hundreds of pirates to their\Ndeaths over the course of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it only took Gold Roger a single\Nblow to put the behemoth down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With lightning speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here's the wound that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killer Giant was a terrible\Nwaste of human flesh anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he proclaimed with his dying breath,!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, I take my hat off to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will forever be the\Nking of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'd heard he'd conquered the\NGrand Line, I wasn't surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was happy to hear that he was the one\Nwho finally survived those evil seas, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On this day 22 years ago, Gold\NRoger died on that platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's how it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The so-called Great Pirate Era, where\Neveryone with a boat claims to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look around this once great town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you won't be able to\Nfind yourself a real pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing here but cowards and scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men brave enough to\Nmake the journey to the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grand Line have all\Ndisappeared from these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no more true pirates\Nleft, that's why I'm closing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, Gold Roger's so cool, he's\Nexactly how a pirate's supposed to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here, to go to the Grand\NLine, get my hands on the One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, those are some pretty big words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even more so because you're in this bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only said what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if there are still people\Nlike you out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should I hold off on closing this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could just be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.36,0:10:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could just be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, let's have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been in this\Ngood a mood in some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I don't drink alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.00,0:10:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's raise our glasses together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the eternal King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to the King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an elephant bluefin tuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have got mixed\Nin from the south blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it with pole and lime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a pole and lime?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue fin tuna fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go. Lift it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.92,0:11:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.76,0:11:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sell the fish to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got everything I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm completely prepared for\Nwhatever the sea can throw at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything Usopp\NBrave Warrior can't face now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm forgetting\Nsomething important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A first-class sniper\Nlike myself should really
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have a top-shelf pair of\Ngoggles to look through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get the best pair I can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they cost,\Nunless it's more than I can afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Goggles, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are brand new.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the top-of-the-line\Nmodel from North Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the import ship I get them from\Nonly stops here in port once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you have any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.44,0:12:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just give these away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, excellent choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what a cute little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I happen to know that these are the only\Ngoggles of their kind on the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are my goggles! Drop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You snooze, you lose, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little girl, stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.14,0:12:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way you could\Npossibly think I'm an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm more like an older brother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you smell like an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not old!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me back those goggles!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found them first!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm friends with the Marines\Nand I'll get them to beat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Marines? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And their captain is a close\Npersonal friend of my family's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kind of like my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you little... Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a great captain, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.34,0:13:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our Long Park was destroyed\Nby these two hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was surrounded by hundreds of fishmen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the last thing they ever saw\Nwas Captain Usopp the Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doing such amazing and terrible things,\Nthey were glad to quickly meet their end!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I have a bounty of 30 million berries\Non my head so Marines don't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, 30 million berries, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not your daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carol, you are absolutely the most angelic\Nlittle girl a father could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you so much, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.40,0:14:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Papa,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that silly old man over there was being\Nmean and trying to jack your present!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.18,0:14:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say jack, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a proper young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the gentleman that's been\Nbothering my adorable little daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bounty of 30 million Briss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a bounty worth 30 million, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, are those the new bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just picked them up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,600, 1.3 mil, 700, 30\Nmillion, Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a first bounty, that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:14:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, that's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the guy in the poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to\Npretend to be a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.10,0:15:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye bye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here! Bye! See ya! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you caught me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But just try and lay a hand on\Nme and you'll see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Captain Luffy won't sit idly by\Nand watch one of his crew in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a cold-blooded soulless demon\Nfrom the very pits of hell itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even imagine the\Npain that he can inflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got your daughter to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why risk your life over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone worth 30 million berries on his\Nhead is no ordinary man, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoppa, you can beat him,\Nyou're the strongest man ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.16,0:15:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're not afraid of anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darling, I don't have to prove anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to get by with\Nenough to keep us happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long as you think I'm the greatest,\Nthat's all that matters to me, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hoppa, I scared him off just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't know how\Ntruly terrifying I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to flex!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came to your senses fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now give me my goggles and just maybe\NI'll let you escape with your life Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pay for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a killer not a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now give them here. He's\Nletting you go, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were you I'd be running for my life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how you want\Nit then let's settle
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this dispute like gentlemen gentlemen here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I can manage that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you win, then the goggles are yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, three, four, six, 30 pistols!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the same number of\Nguns as Daddy the Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.76,0:16:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Daddy the Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gonna be a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who can be that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy the Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows that\NDaddy the Father is the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,greatest gunslinger in\Nbounty hunter history.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:17:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention he's\Nnever lost a duel before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what kind of idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Long Nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a whole duck for\Nyou already, so relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I dueling this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk ten paces and fire. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing? Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're facing\NDaddy the Father in a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.26,0:17:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never have anything nice to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.28,0:17:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.34,0:17:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing? This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:18:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid, there's\Nno way I can beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And six?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seven?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.32,0:18:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.96,0:18:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My adventure is just beginning\Nand I'm already gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought it would come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa, that was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen\Nsuch a cowardly move in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you no shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm cheating during a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed of\Nyourself, it's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just really too\Nscared to die this young.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing me would be too\Neasy for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please don't shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could just let me go, couldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, if you want money, my friend\Nhere has tons she can give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please spare me, I'm begging\Nyou, sir. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, now you're cowering behind a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, leave her out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one that got myself into this\Nsituation, and nobody can get me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.74,0:19:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.65,0:19:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just leave Nami out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she just call you Usopp? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't by any chance know a man by
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of Yasopp of\Nthe Red Hair Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you? Yasopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my dad's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying that you\Nand my father are friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then you are his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met your dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've never spoken a single word\Nto anyone about that fateful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until now, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We met in a hot, dry port of call\Non a day very much like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.76,0:20:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ensign Masterson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One shot each.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, finish me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for me to live anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect a\Ncold-blooded marine like
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself to be treasuring\Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess she must be really special.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what would a dirty\Npirate know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were awesome, Yasopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wounded him instead of killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.54,0:21:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still need more practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but the rest of us\Nwould have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took on Daddy Masterson and lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm glad you let me duel him\Ninstead of just killing him on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hits the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you want some marine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Family, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never wrap my\Nmind around that job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I've got a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen him in years, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left him for the sea just when he\Nstarted walking. Why didn't you love him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it wasn't that I loved him\Nplenty it's just that I loved
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something else more the sea\Nwas calling for me amen brother
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it may be too late for me to do anything\Nfor my son, and I truly regret that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, your daughter, she deserves\Nto have a parent with her by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever let her go\Nwhile you have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm the one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost our duel, Yasopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.00,0:22:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me here like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You owe that much to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Marines may have to follow the\Nrules and do everything by the book,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.86,0:22:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the best part about being a pirate\Nis that I can do whatever I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.10,0:22:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate didn't spare your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me it's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.10,0:23:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father must have been amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.04,0:23:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He beat Daddy the Father! Usopp? I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand why you tell me\Nthat story about my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told me that so I would\Ntry to be more like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.24,0:23:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.15,0:23:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You embarrassed yourself for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.88,0:23:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put yourself beneath me so I would\Nknow what type of man my father was!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most people would just bury that\Nstory and never tell it to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, you're not afraid\Nof anything, even shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A coward would never do what you just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Carol, your dad is the bravest man alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men who are big and\Nstrong are easy to find,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the ones who put their honor on the\Nline for others are one in a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.60,0:23:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.94,0:23:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I accept your dad's mercy,\Nit'll only bring him more shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.22,0:23:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have one choice, and\Nthat is to face my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.30,0:23:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to prove to myself\Nthat I am not a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A life or death fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.98,0:24:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choose the weapon you feel\Nmost comfortable with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be our final duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.10,0:24:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.01,0:24:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must hit that\Nweather vane. What? That?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.96,0:24:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.86,0:24:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.77,0:24:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll shoot me through the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this shot determines whether\NI live or die with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.06,0:24:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can shoot\Nthat far with a slingshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.30,0:25:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.70,0:25:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill him, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.44,0:25:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.38,0:25:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't shoot him because he\Nshot right through the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.22,0:25:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it, Usopp! He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.98,0:25:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.42,0:25:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as good a shot as your\Nold man, and a brave one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father will be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.24,0:25:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll find him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves to see what\Nhis son has become.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.42,0:25:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.66,0:25:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a pretty good shot, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.62,0:25:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.32,0:25:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Carol, don't say later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.06,0:25:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bad manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.66,0:26:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.22,0:26:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try to be a nice\Nlittle girl from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.48,0:26:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little age, you're nice enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.38,0:26:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm gonna be even nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When people say Daddy the\NFather is a disgraced Marine,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.06,0:26:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at least we'll know the real story.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.86,0:26:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father will see me as\Na true warrior someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.76,0:26:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see, I'll be as brave as Daddy, the\Nfather, and I will make my father proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.18,0:26:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.94,0:26:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's you now, that's no\Nway to treat a customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.10,0:26:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially you're only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have a right\Nto be angry with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.98,0:26:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't turn all the pirates\Naround here into cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.20,0:26:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a decision they all made\Nonce they got to know me, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.64,0:26:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.34,0:26:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you had a guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.96,0:27:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like a taste of rum, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.82,0:27:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.48,0:27:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is a very special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.10,0:27:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.74,0:27:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.56,0:27:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see it like it was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.46,0:27:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day he was executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.16,0:27:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.00,0:27:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.96,0:27:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had him shackled as\Nthey led him down Main Street
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.24,0:27:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,towards the square where they\Nbuilt the execution platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.10,0:27:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He walked through town like\Nit was a victory parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Novenidos to the Wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goldrorj retains me a Wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.38,0:28:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my family will never
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.26,0:28:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wealth. Fame. Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.66,0:28:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goldrodj retains me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.96,0:28:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This and everything\Nelse life had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.80,0:28:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was facing his final\Nmoments before death,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.14,0:28:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he acted like it was his coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.68,0:28:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.26,0:28:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.76,0:28:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.78,0:28:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.22,0:28:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.52,0:28:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any final words to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.82,0:28:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind taking these off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.66,0:28:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're beginning to chafe me quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.47,0:28:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.39,0:28:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I going to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.46,0:29:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.68,0:29:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm on my own for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.58,0:29:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.88,0:29:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pirate King!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.92,0:29:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us where in the hell you've\Nhidden all of your treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.94,0:29:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it in the Grand Line or someplace else?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.22,0:29:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legendary treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.92,0:29:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The One Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.66,0:29:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.60,0:30:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.12,0:30:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.82,0:30:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.66,0:30:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.74,0:30:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.40,0:30:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, here's a new wanted poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.64,0:30:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it where people can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.30,0:30:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker, my apologies, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.22,0:31:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.22,0:31:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.06,0:31:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid was Monkey T. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.26,0:31:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.68,0:31:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The place where the greatest\Npirate who ever lived died.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.70,0:31:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the place where the\Ngreat pirate age began.

